{#- The Free Video Plan: what's in it. Used on the homepage and /free-video-plan/. Set planLink=true to show the button. -#}
<ol class="plan" role="list">
  <li class="plan__part">
    <span class="plan__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
    <h3>Your story in one line</h3>
    <p>The angle that makes your business worth watching, and how I'd film it. The seed of a brand film or documentary. {% draft %}</p>
  </li>
  <li class="plan__part">
    <span class="plan__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
    <h3>3 short-form ideas for this month</h3>
    <p>Each with the opening hook written out. Simple enough to shoot on your phone, whether or not we ever work together. {% draft %}</p>
  </li>
  <li class="plan__part">
    <span class="plan__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
    <h3>What others in your industry do well</h3>
    <p>A quick look at who's getting video right in your space, and what you can borrow from them. {% draft %}</p>
  </li>
  <li class="plan__part">
    <span class="plan__num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
    <h3>What's holding your video back</h3>
    <p>Honest notes on your website, socials and ads. Not posting yet? Then it's where to start. {% draft %}</p>
  </li>
</ol>
<div class="plan__delivery">
  <p><strong>How you get it:</strong> a 10-minute personal video walkthrough and a one-page plan, in your inbox within 2 business days. Then, if you like, a call to talk it through. {% draft %}</p>
  {%- if planLink %}
  <div class="plan__cta">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.ctaUrl }}#request">{{ site.ctaLabel }} <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    {% include "partials/text-alt.njk" %}
    <span class="plan__reassure">No obligation. Useful even if we never work together. {% draft %}</span>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</div>
